## Refining Operations

Titan Energy has three refineries located in Texas, Louisiana, and California, with a total refining capacity of 600,000 barrels per day. These facilities convert crude oil into gasoline, diesel, and other petrochemicals.

### Refinery Capacity (2023)
| Refinery Location | Capacity (Bbl/d) | Products Produced                       | Operational Status |  
|-------------------|-------------------|----------------------------------------|--------------------|  
| Houston, TX       | 300,000           | Gasoline, Diesel, Jet Fuel             | Active             |  
| Baton Rouge, LA   | 200,000           | Petrochemical Feedstocks, LPG          | Active             |  
| Richmond, CA      | 100,000           | Biofuels, Lubricants                   | Active             |  

### Recent Upgrades
- **Hydrocracking Units**: Installed in Baton Rouge to increase yield.
- **Waste Heat Recovery Systems**: Implemented in Houston to improve energy efficiency.

